Design attribution
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The user interface, message model, filter query language, settings, Logcat
color scheme (LogcatColorSchemeDarcula.xml values), tag color palette
(palette/logcat-tags-palette.json values) and `.logcat` export format are
modeled on the Logcat tool window of Android Studio, developed as part of the
Android Open Source Project (AOSP):

    https://android.googlesource.com/platform/tools/adt/idea/  (module: logcat/)

    Copyright The Android Open Source Project
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

The code in this repository is an independent re-implementation and does not
depend on the IntelliJ Platform or the Android Studio plugin. Any source file
that is copied or adapted from AOSP in the future MUST keep its original
"Copyright The Android Open Source Project" header and carry a notice that it
was modified (Apache License 2.0, Section 4).

UI colors are taken from the IntelliJ Platform "Islands Dark" theme
(ManyIslandsDark.theme.json) and the "Dark" editor color scheme.
Copyright JetBrains s.r.o. and contributors; Apache License, Version 2.0.

